    "finalName": "",
    "description": "Realizing how devastating the consequences would have been if the Sith had successfully deceived her and her companions during the Jedi Civil War, Shasa has developed a technique for using <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to detect deceptions. You gain +5 to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> against uses of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> skill.<br><br>Additionally, you can make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check instead of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Deception\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Deception\">Sense Deception</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sense_Influence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sense Influence\">Sense Influence</a>. You are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> for the purposes of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check reroll, you may reroll your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).",
